    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get that but i've been on the omeprazole for a while now and my stomach feels okay most of the time. wouldn't the omeprazole basically protect my stomach from the ibuprofen? i've heard it stops the acid so it should be fine right? just a couple of advils shouldn't hurt",
