      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just really dont want to wait for a doctor's appointment or a call back right now because the tooth is throbbing so bad and i'm trying to sleep. i've taken ibuprofen a million times before and never had an issue. if i just stick to a low dose, like like 200mg or 400mg, is that really gonna make a difference to my stomach? it seems like a small risk compared to this tooth pain.",
